# Changelog

## 2026-06-02 (LLM)

### Added

- `backend/llm_service.py` — OpenAI integration: `parse_to_json`, `optimize_experience`; mock fallback when key is missing or call fails.
- `POST /api/parse/{id}` — parse `raw_text` to structured JSON, save `parsed_data`.
- `POST /api/optimize/{id}` — STAR-optimize experience in `parsed_data`, save `optimized_data`.

### Changed

- `backend/main.py` — wire parse and optimize routes to `llm_service`.
- `backend/API.md` — document parse/optimize endpoints, JSON schema, and LLM env config.
- `README.md` — endpoint table, `.env` setup note for `OPENAI_API_KEY`.

## 2026-06-02

### Added

- `.cursor/rules/project-global-standards.mdc` — always-on Cursor rules: stack (Next.js + Tailwind / FastAPI + SQLite), minimal code style, SQLite single-table by resume ID, LLM try-except with mock fallback.

### Changed

- `README.md` — project overview and link to Cursor project standards.
- `.gitignore` — ignore `package-lock.json`.

## 2026-06-02 (backend)

### Added

- `backend/database.py` — SQLAlchemy sync SQLite engine (`resume.db`), session factory, `get_db` dependency.
- `backend/models.py` — `Resume` model: UUID `id`, `filename`, `raw_text`, `parsed_data`, `optimized_data`.
- `backend/main.py` — FastAPI app with CORS, lifespan table creation, health / upload / resume routes.
- `backend/run.py` — uvicorn dev server startup script (`python run.py`).
- `backend/API.md` — REST API documentation (endpoints, request/response, errors).

### Changed

- `README.md` — backend quick start and API endpoint summary.
